      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis 运行态\n\n队列\n- monitor delay\n- monitor ready\n- collect\n- publish\n\n锁\n- lock:{workerType}\n- resource-lock:*\n\nlease + expiry index\npending human pool",
